OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers protest over 800 green
OL,4,Abelt homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FShropshire villagers have staged a
OL,7,Fprotest walk in their battle against a
OL,8,Fplan to build 800 homes on "vital"
OL,9,Fgreen belt land.
OL,11,FProposals for construction, off
OL,12,FPatshull Road in Albrighton, were
OL,13,Frefused by Shropshire Council, but will
OL,14,Fnow be subject to a planning inquiry
OL,15,Fnext week after developer Boningale
OL,16,FDevelopments appealed against the
OL,17,Fdecision.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
