OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers protest over 800 green
OL,4,Abelt homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have said the homes would be
OL,7,Fan overdevelopment, removing the only
OL,8,Fgreen space in the area for people to
OL,9,Fenjoy "recreation" and a "bit of
OL,10,Ftherapy".
OL,12,FParish council chair Adrian Robinson
OL,13,Fagreed the village does not have the
OL,14,Finfrastructure to cope with a
OL,15,Fdevelopment of that size. Boningale
OL,16,FHomes said it did not currently want to
OL,17,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
